        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-08-22T18:44:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Katsue\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/katsue/48/2012_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Katsue:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Self-explanatory, really.Hmm…it seems as if she doesn't have line of sight to herself if she's in cover, since she's not adjacent to herself.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You might have to be more specific here.</p>\n<p>If you are talking about some of her powers, she will not have LoS to herself. This was discussed a lot during PTing so hopefully someone else chimes in, or if you could define what you mean in relation to another card or character that would be helpful</p>\n<p>Edit: She can't Twist the Ether or Wrest the Mind on herself if I remember correctly from PTing</p>",
