        "raw": "[quote=\"Katsue\"]\n\nSelf-explanatory, really.Hmm...it seems as if she doesn&#39;t have line of sight to herself if she&#39;s in cover, since she&#39;s not adjacent to herself.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou might have to be more specific here.\n\nIf you are talking about some of her powers, she will not have LoS to herself. This was discussed a lot during PTing so hopefully someone else chimes in, or if you could define what you mean in relation to another card or character that would be helpful\n\nEdit: She can&#39;t Twist the Ether or Wrest the Mind on herself if I remember correctly from PTing\n",
