        "created_at": "2014-08-22T19:13:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The wording of Foresight is important.</p><p>Foresight specifically counts out Visionary as a target for her power. &nbsp;Any of her other powers that is any target in line of sight can be used on Visionary.</p><p>I remember that change to make it clear that she couldn't foresight herself.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
